Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PC5: a crash the game's own handler takes is reported first
 (Wine patch 0924)

A game with a crash handler of its own (it writes a dump and starts a
crash reporter the PS5 can't start) left only a fault count in the log:
Wine reached its crash report only once the handler passed the crash on.
The crash is now reported, registers and stack, before the game's handler
runs, and not again when that handler passes it on.
